- A command raising CommandError('Settings file is stale; run setup again.') from a ValueError prints only that message to stderr and exits 1
- A command raising RuntimeError('secret detail') prints only 'RuntimeError' and exits 1
- An executable flag --diagnose raising CommandError('Config is broken.') prints that message and exits 1
- issubclass(CommandError, InterfacyError) is False from the installed package
